## Third-party art

This MIT licence covers the source code in this repository. It does not cover
the image files under `apps/game/public/art/`, which are not ours to relicense.

Those come from "[FREE] 16x16 Top Down Puzzle System - Asset Pack" by LorisC
(https://lorisc.itch.io/puzzle-system-asset-pack) and are used under the pack's
own terms, which permit use in a game and withhold redistribution. Full detail,
and what was and was not taken, is in `apps/game/public/art/CREDITS.md`.

The distinction matters: MIT grants redistribution and the pack's terms do not,
so nothing in this file should be read as permission to redistribute that art.
